{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "20歳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮地すみれです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˹BOMB˼7月号"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮地すみれと渡辺莉奈で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "表紙･巻頭を務めさせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんな機会なかなかないだろうなと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい気持ちで胸がいっぱいになります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影では古民家や川へ行きまして、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏をひと足早く感じてきました ᵕ ᵕ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobkgfzxj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mob3Ng8Z6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mob08gO6a.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobVieeTM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobulOEW2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobKKS1tB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobhU8oYL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "川遊びをして、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "朝ごはんもいただいて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スカートもちゃんと揺らしてきました︎☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、インタビューでは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二人の関係性やユニット曲の裏側など..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめて話す内容も沢山ですので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そちらも併せてお楽しみください💭"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobJfklZs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あたたかくて優しいスタッフのみなさまと、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな莉奈と、笑顔溢れる一日でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今の私たちの姿をこうして"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "切り取って残してくださり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "感謝しかありません︎ ᵕ ᵕ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この一冊は私たちにとって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大切な思い出です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すみりな推しのみなさんの手元にも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しっかりと届きますように..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誌面には陽世さんも登場しております⚾️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˹BOMB˼7月号"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ お迎えしてくださると嬉しいです!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこの辺で。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね。"}], "source": "official"}